OL,3,GNEWSAPilgrim's trail inspires 81-mile
OL,4,Aultra run
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 24-hour ultra-marathon inspired by a
OL,7,F17th Century preacher will get under
OL,8,Fway later.
OL,10,FRunners will depart from Bedford and
OL,11,Floop into the countryside for the
OL,12,Finaugural 81-mile (130 km) Pilgrim's
OL,13,FReckoning.
OL,15,FRace director Sarah Groves said that
OL,16,Fwhile out on training runs, she kept
OL,17,Fseeing markers for the John Bunyan
OL,18,FTrail, which was a pilgrimage linking
OL,19,Fthe churches associated with writer
OL,20,FJohn Bunyan.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
