OL,3,GNEWSAPilgrim's trail inspires 81-mile
OL,4,Aultra run
OL,5,
OL,6,F"After seeing how beautiful it was, I
OL,7,Fthought I had to share it with other
OL,8,Fpeople, and that's how it was born,"
OL,9,Fshe explained.
